#: ../../../projects/async-mlp-pipeline.md:504
msgid ""
"**Add a softmax layer.** Write a `#[kernel]` that computes the [numerically "
"stable softmax](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Softmax_function) across the "
"64-element output vector. Chain it with another `.and_then` after ReLU."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects/async-mlp-pipeline.md:509
msgid ""
"**Profile at larger dimensions.** Change `DIM` to 512 or 1024. Watch the "
"GEMM dominate the timeline. Then replace `sgemm_naive` with a tiled version "
"using `SharedArray` and observe the speedup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects/async-mlp-pipeline.md:513
msgid ""
"**Add error recovery.** Replace `.unwrap()` in the kernel launch closures "
"with proper `Result` propagation. Use the three-arm `match` pattern from the "
"{ref}`Concurrent Execution <concurrent-error-handling>` chapter to handle "
"GPU errors and task panics independently."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projects/async-mlp-pipeline.md:518
msgid ""
"**Multi-device.** Pass `init_device_contexts(0, 2)` to manage two GPUs. "
"Build a batch splitter that routes even batches to GPU 0 and odd batches to "
"GPU 1."
